{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02956","headline":"兴庆池侍宴应制 · 苏瓌","name":"兴庆池侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金阙平明宿雾收，瑶池式宴俯清流。\n瑞凤飞来随帝辇，祥鱼出戏跃王舟。\n帷齐绿树当筵密，盖转缃荷接岸浮。\n如临窃比微臣惧，若济叨陪圣主游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏瓌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}